1
00:01:42,599 --> 00:01:44,040
Put it all on my tab.

2
00:01:45,359 --> 00:01:47,599
At the casino, you win some, you lose some.

3
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:48,480
If you lose today,

4
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,879
just win it back tomorrow, right?

5
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:52,319
Don't let a little money like this

6
00:01:52,319 --> 00:01:53,519
make me think less of you.

7
00:01:54,079 --> 00:01:55,719
Besides, this isn't thrilling enough.

8
00:01:57,599 --> 00:01:59,680
In a bit, I'll show you something far more exciting.

9
00:02:00,359 --> 00:02:00,799
Brother Biao.

10
00:02:02,159 --> 00:02:02,680
Did they talk?

11
00:02:03,439 --> 00:02:04,000
They did.

12
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:06,879
Rat Qiang's men put them up to it.

13
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,840
They sure have some nerve.

14
00:02:21,439 --> 00:02:22,719
Brother Biao, Brother Biao!

15
00:02:23,639 --> 00:02:25,879
Brother Biao, it's this punk.

16
00:02:26,039 --> 00:02:27,439
He brought guys and robbed our stash.

17
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,520
Didn't your parents ever teach you

18
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:35,159
that taking other people's stuff is wrong?

19
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,000
Fine.

20
00:02:41,759 --> 00:02:43,439
Since you love taking things so much,

21
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:49,159
I'll give you this vial of potassium cyanide.

22
00:02:51,719 --> 00:02:53,080
It might not look like much,

23
00:02:53,879 --> 00:02:54,719
but it's more than enough

24
00:02:54,719 --> 00:02:56,439
to send you straight to the other side.

25
00:03:00,479 --> 00:03:03,120
Brother Biao, killing someone over something like this...

26
00:03:03,719 --> 00:03:04,240
is it really worth it?

27
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,719
I don't want to kill him either.

28
00:03:07,439 --> 00:03:10,039
But he keeps stealing my shipments

29
00:03:10,199 --> 00:03:11,240
and muscling in on my turf.

30
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,319
How am I supposed to run things?

31
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,240
Murder is a major crime.

32
00:03:19,719 --> 00:03:20,960
The cops will definitely hunt us down.

33
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,360
That can't be good for business, right?

34
00:03:25,599 --> 00:03:27,199
Why do you sound like a cop?

35
00:03:29,639 --> 00:03:30,879
Brother Biao, you've got me wrong.

36
00:03:30,879 --> 00:03:31,639
What I mean is,

37
00:03:31,639 --> 00:03:32,639
no matter what we do,

38
00:03:32,639 --> 00:03:33,919
we always need to watch our backs.

39
00:03:34,439 --> 00:03:35,439
So what you're saying is...

40
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,479
we should let him go?

41
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:49,639
Brother Biao, Brother Biao, I was wrong!

42
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:50,919
Please spare my life!

43
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,759
I'll do whatever you tell me from now on!

44
00:03:53,759 --> 00:03:55,080
Brother Biao, I was wrong!

45
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,159
Spare my life!

46
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,319
Brother Biao!

47
00:03:57,879 --> 00:03:58,479
Don't kill me!

48
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:00,960
Don't kill me!

49
00:04:01,439 --> 00:04:03,520
Brother Biao, have mercy and spare me!

50
00:04:04,159 --> 00:04:05,479
Since you're begging like this,

51
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:07,599
I won't kill you.

52
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,159
Thank you, Brother Biao!

53
00:04:09,879 --> 00:04:10,319
You do it.

54
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,959
Getting to work with me so soon,

55
00:04:18,439 --> 00:04:19,639
the boys aren't convinced.

56
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:22,079
Every one of them has blood on their hands.

57
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,519
You've got to get some on yours, too.

58
00:04:34,279 --> 00:04:34,959
Brother!

59
00:04:35,519 --> 00:04:36,560
We've got no beef between us!

60
00:04:36,959 --> 00:04:38,040
Don't kill me, please!

61
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,160
Brother, what are you doing?

62
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:42,680
Brother!

63
00:04:42,839 --> 00:04:43,839
Brother, what are you doing?

64
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:45,759
Brother!

65
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:48,720
Brother, have mercy! Spare my life!

66
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:49,600
Spare my life!

67
00:04:50,839 --> 00:04:52,600
I'm begging you, spare my life!

68
00:04:53,279 --> 00:04:54,800
Have mercy, don't kill me!

69
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:56,720
Brother, please don't kill me!

70
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:00,040
I...

71
00:05:00,399 --> 00:05:00,959
I...

72
00:05:02,399 --> 00:05:03,680
Damn, you're ruthless.

73
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:10,959
Nice.

74
00:05:15,839 --> 00:05:16,800
What's the meaning of this?

75
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:17,639
Brother Kai.

76
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:19,879
Brother Kai, it was just a joke.

77
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:21,000
We're all brothers here.

78
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:24,720
We just wanted to test your nerve.

79
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:25,879
Test me?

80
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,240
None of you trust me, do you?

81
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,480
Fine, Brother Biao.

82
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:30,360
If you don't trust me,

83
00:05:30,519 --> 00:05:31,600
then find someone else.

84
00:05:32,519 --> 00:05:33,160
Brother Kai.

85
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,920
Brother Kai, cool off for a second.

86
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:41,480
Everyone has to pass this test.

87
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:44,360
Only when we know what each other is made of

88
00:05:44,519 --> 00:05:45,920
can we work together with confidence.

89
00:05:47,839 --> 00:05:48,600
Walk away then!

90
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:51,120
Did I beg you to come?

91
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:53,439
I already told you,

92
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:55,199
everyone has to go through this.

93
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,480
So what if we tested you?

94
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,600
Five million a year. You in or out?

95
00:06:19,439 --> 00:06:20,600
From now on,

96
00:06:21,519 --> 00:06:23,959
we're in the same boat.

97
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:46,600
Stop.

98
00:06:49,199 --> 00:06:49,639
Rewind.

99
00:06:54,279 --> 00:06:54,920
That's the guy

100
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:57,040
who walked out of the bank with Qian Feng.

101
00:08:10,399 --> 00:08:11,040
Elvis.

102
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:12,600
What?

103
00:08:15,199 --> 00:08:16,839
Some big shots from the capital just arrived.

104
00:08:17,279 --> 00:08:18,000
What big shots?

105
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:21,319
Mu Qing, a heavyweight in success coaching.

106
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,439
Mu Qing?

107
00:08:24,879 --> 00:08:26,000
Doesn't ring a bell.

108
00:08:26,519 --> 00:08:28,040
You must've heard of William Han, right?

109
00:08:28,959 --> 00:08:30,439
William Han?

110
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:32,919
Sounds pretty westernized.

111
00:08:33,279 --> 00:08:34,200
Probably a fake foreigner.

112
00:08:36,519 --> 00:08:37,399
Let me tell you,

113
00:08:37,759 --> 00:08:40,559
William Han is a prominent success guru.

114
00:08:40,759 --> 00:08:42,120
He's even published bestselling books.

115
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:43,720
Success coaching?

116
00:08:46,879 --> 00:08:48,720
Tell him to teach me how to succeed, then.

117
00:08:51,279 --> 00:08:53,039
That's why I say you lack vision.

118
00:08:53,759 --> 00:08:54,919
Ultimate Execution...

119
00:08:55,159 --> 00:08:56,080
Ever heard of that book?

120
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,360
He's the one who wrote it.

121
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,759
It's something tons of young folks

122
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:01,200
revere as a motivational bible.

123
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,519
Though,

124
00:09:04,679 --> 00:09:06,840
I only learned this at yesterday's lecture.

125
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,639
And this Mu Qing I mentioned

126
00:09:08,799 --> 00:09:10,440
is the big boss behind William Han.

127
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:11,840
I'm telling you,

128
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:15,240
we're dealing with successful elites this time.

129
00:09:15,399 --> 00:09:17,200
I'm bringing her over to meet you.

130
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:21,279
Try your best to act cultured.

131
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:22,759
Don't let them take one look at you

132
00:09:22,759 --> 00:09:23,759
and think you're some dimwit punk.

133
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,320
Don't worry.

134
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,720
When it comes to class,

135
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,759
I've got it totally nailed.

136
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,519
Just tell me when you'll be here.

137
00:09:33,759 --> 00:09:34,360
We'll be there shortly.

138
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:10,000
All right.

139
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:13,279
Having a blast, huh?

140
00:10:13,279 --> 00:10:13,840
Good times!

141
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:14,320
Great!

142
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,080
Sister Xin.

143
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,279
A customer just told me

144
00:10:19,279 --> 00:10:20,480
that the table outside is too loud.

145
00:10:20,639 --> 00:10:21,600
So I went out and told them

146
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:22,480
to keep it down,

147
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:23,480
but they completely ignored me.

148
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:26,120
It's fine. Go take care of other things.

149
00:10:26,279 --> 00:10:26,919
I'll go check on them.

150
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:32,360
What the hell are you looking at?

151
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:35,159
Whatever.

152
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:39,120
Come on, a toast to you, bro.

153
00:10:39,279 --> 00:10:40,480
Drink it yourself.

154
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:41,799
Excuse me, gentlemen.

155
00:10:42,159 --> 00:10:42,960
Sorry to interrupt.

156
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:45,279
Could you please keep your voices down?

157
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:46,440
There are other customers nearby.

158
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:49,000
What's your damn problem?

159
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:52,240
We're paying customers here!

160
00:10:53,759 --> 00:10:55,159
We can't even have a chat?

161
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,399
Yeah, exactly!

162
00:10:56,639 --> 00:10:57,720
Of course you can.

163
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,759
Just please lower your voices a bit.

164
00:11:00,879 --> 00:11:02,480
Listen here, you bitch.

165
00:11:02,759 --> 00:11:04,080
You got a death wish?

166
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:06,200
Do you have any idea who our boss is?

167
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,960
The lady boss is so gorgeous,

168
00:11:12,639 --> 00:11:14,080
and you two are being so rude to her.

169
00:11:15,519 --> 00:11:16,039
Come on.

170
00:11:19,879 --> 00:11:21,759
As long as she downs this drink for me,

171
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:24,399
the three of us will do whatever you say.

172
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,559
Yeah, whatever you say!

173
00:11:27,879 --> 00:11:28,679
I'm sorry,

174
00:11:28,679 --> 00:11:29,759
I... I don't drink.

175
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:32,440
Is that so?

176
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:33,759
When I tell you to drink, you drink!

177
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,679
Cut the bullshit!

178
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:36,840
Come on, have a drink!

179
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:37,639
Drink!

180
00:11:37,799 --> 00:11:39,200
Come on, drink up!

181
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:39,720
Take a drink!

182
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,240
Drink it! Drink it!

183
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,039
You fucking bitch!

184
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:47,440
Who the hell are you?

185
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:48,519
You wanna die?

186
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:58,799
I'll give you ten seconds.

187
00:11:59,120 --> 00:11:59,960
Get the fuck out of here.

188
00:12:00,639 --> 00:12:01,200
Scram!

189
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,159
Thanks.

190
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:19,840
You're welcome.

191
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:21,799
What a coincidence.

192
00:12:21,799 --> 00:12:22,519
We meet again.

193
00:12:26,159 --> 00:12:27,279
What, don't you recognize me?

194
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:28,200
You're Tian Xin.

195
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,519
We've met before.

196
00:12:31,039 --> 00:12:32,639
Though I had no idea this was your café.

197
00:12:35,559 --> 00:12:36,240
P-Please, have a seat.

198
00:12:36,399 --> 00:12:37,639
I... I'll go...

199
00:12:37,919 --> 00:12:38,919
N-No, don't bother.

200
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:41,279
I'm actually meeting someone.

201
00:12:46,879 --> 00:12:48,159
I wonder when

202
00:12:48,159 --> 00:12:49,600
we'll be able to meet again.

203
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:52,840
If we do meet next time,

204
00:12:52,919 --> 00:12:54,720
I hope you can sit down and have a real chat with me.

205
00:12:57,759 --> 00:12:58,120
I'm off.

206
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:10,240
Sis, right here.

207
00:14:31,279 --> 00:14:31,799
Boss,

208
00:14:32,159 --> 00:14:34,320
Elvis will soon bring someone named Mu Qing

209
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,559
to Xu Duoduo's place.

210
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,080
They're meeting tonight,

211
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:38,960
most likely to discuss their next deal.

212
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:41,000
So you must find out

213
00:14:41,559 --> 00:14:43,080
the exact details of that deal.

214
00:14:43,679 --> 00:14:44,240
Copy that.

215
00:15:08,559 --> 00:15:09,080
Captain Lu,

216
00:15:09,799 --> 00:15:10,919
should I head over there now?

217
00:15:12,759 --> 00:15:13,240
No need.

218
00:15:14,039 --> 00:15:15,120
Li Qiang hasn't even shown up yet,

219
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:17,559
and the deal won't happen today anyway.

220
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:18,519
Go on.

221
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:25,120
Qian Feng and Li Xia

222
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:27,000
actually rarely met in person.

223
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,120
Their emotional connection

224
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:31,200
was mainly Qian Feng's financial aid to Li Xia.

225
00:15:31,679 --> 00:15:32,919
Furthermore, their neighbors

226
00:15:33,039 --> 00:15:34,960
knew nothing about their relationship.

227
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,080
In Li Xia's home,

228
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:39,639
we found no valuable leads either.

229
00:15:40,519 --> 00:15:42,120
Of the two women in Qian Feng's life,

230
00:15:42,399 --> 00:15:43,519
one refuses to talk,

231
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:44,759
and the other knows nothing.

232
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:46,279
Where do we take the case from here?

233
00:15:50,799 --> 00:15:52,480
The suspect from Baijia Alley...

234
00:15:53,039 --> 00:15:53,600
any news on him?

235
00:15:55,559 --> 00:15:57,519
Zhuang Yan and Ge Dan pulled two

236
00:15:57,519 --> 00:15:58,679
stills from surveillance footage.

237
00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:00,159
Tao'er, put them up.

238
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:05,159
As for these two photos,

239
00:16:05,159 --> 00:16:07,480
one shows his back, the other his profile.

240
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:10,559
But the suspect's facial features

241
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:11,799
aren't clearly visible.

242
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:19,720
Could we try a sketch artist?

243
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:21,759
See if they can use these two photos

244
00:16:22,039 --> 00:16:23,720
to reconstruct the suspect's face.

245
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:27,799
Didn't Zhuang Yan successfully sketch

246
00:16:27,799 --> 00:16:28,639
Geng Hao's portrait last time?

247
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:30,000
Let him do it again.

248
00:16:30,039 --> 00:16:31,200
That was just pure luck.

249
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:33,200
Besides, there were many eyewitnesses

250
00:16:33,559 --> 00:16:35,519
giving details on his appearance,

251
00:16:35,519 --> 00:16:36,759
and I'd also seen him myself.

252
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:39,240
But this time,

253
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:43,519
we really need a master sketch artist.

254
00:16:45,519 --> 00:16:47,600
Experts like that are rare in the country.

255
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:48,559
Take Nanhai, for example.

256
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:50,159
In a place like Nanhai,

257
00:16:50,159 --> 00:16:52,120
there's actually a master artist like that.

258
00:16:52,799 --> 00:16:53,879
And he's right beside me.

259
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:35,480
For revealing your identity from years ago,

260
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:37,119
you don't blame me, do you?

261
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:43,359
It's fine.

262
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:48,559
No matter what happened in the past,

263
00:17:49,079 --> 00:17:50,599
we should all learn to let go.

264
00:17:51,319 --> 00:17:52,200
Look at Zhuang Yan.

265
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:56,680
Be easier on yourself,

266
00:17:57,920 --> 00:18:00,319
and the road ahead will be a lot lighter.

267
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:01,519
Right?

268
00:18:04,359 --> 00:18:05,160
I'll try.

269
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:09,240
Wait a second, Captain Bai.

270
00:18:10,359 --> 00:18:12,000
Has your next target

271
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:13,440
become me now?

272
00:18:17,559 --> 00:18:18,240
I'll try.

273
00:18:32,039 --> 00:18:32,640
Where are you headed?

274
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:38,079
I'm off work, heading home.

275
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:39,279
Let me give you a ride.

276
00:18:39,799 --> 00:18:40,640
No need.

277
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:41,680
I can just take a cab.

278
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:42,519
It's no trouble.

279
00:18:42,839 --> 00:18:44,200
It's right on my way.

280
00:18:50,480 --> 00:18:51,799
Miss Tian, you don't think

281
00:18:52,839 --> 00:18:53,759
I'm a bad guy, do you?

282
00:18:54,839 --> 00:18:55,759
No, not at all.

283
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,039
Of course not.

284
00:18:57,759 --> 00:19:00,160
You even helped me fight off those thugs.

285
00:19:00,359 --> 00:19:01,039
In that case,

